{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Solar Arc 是一款太陽與月亮追蹤工具，適合攝影、遠足、觀星及戶外規劃人士使用。它把天空光線化成清晰直觀的視圖，並提供黃金時刻、月相與未來 52 週預測，協助使用者安排拍攝和行程。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-66.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時日月弧線追蹤</h2>\n<p>Solar Arc 以會隨天空變化的漸變線與弧線呈現太陽和月亮動態，可拖動查看一天中任何時刻，並切換太陽、月亮或雙視圖。它提供黃金時刻與藍色時刻、月出月落、月相與照明度、52 週預測、五種活動模式、七款主畫面小工具及日出日落通知；支援多地點與自動時區，完全離線運作，無追蹤亦無需帳戶。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-62-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-63-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-64-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-65-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-66-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-67-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Solar Arc: Golden Hour Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/solar-arc-golden-hour-tracker/id6752503669?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.392808+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:15:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:39.855098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:41.420924+00:00","content_hash":"1f43b7999e4975f6ceb870ba05b60b0933c5d7695ef68824f82f9a50ea54649a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}